# 11. Automatic Content Classification

When an administrator uploads:

```text
PDF
DOCX
IMAGE
TEXT
QUESTION PAPER
STUDY MATERIAL
```

NOVA should determine:

```text
Is this:
    MCQ?
    PYQ?
    Study Material?
    Lesson?
    Current Affairs?
    Revision Material?
```

Then determine:

```text
Exam
Section
Subject
Chapter
Topic
Difficulty
Year
Question Type
Language
```

If an existing topic matches:

```text
Attach to existing topic
```

If no topic exists:

```text
Create candidate new topic
```

But creation of new academic taxonomy should ideally enter an admin-review workflow.

