# 16. Diagnostic Placement

The first assessment determines the starting level.

Example:

```text
< 40%       → Orientation
40–64%      → Foundation
65–79%      → Core
80–89%      → Exam Level
90%+        → Advanced
```

The frontend should display:

```text
Your starting level
Why NOVA selected it
What happens next
Estimated journey
```

Do not expose raw algorithmic complexity.

---

