# 18. Mistake Engine

Mistakes should be classified.

Possible classifications:

```text
CONCEPT_GAP
CARELESS_ERROR
TIME_PRESSURE
MISREAD
GUESS
CALCULATION_ERROR
KNOWLEDGE_GAP
```

The user should see:

> "You are making calculation errors in percentage problems."

instead of merely:

> "Wrong answers: 7"

---

# 19. Remediation Engine

If a weekly test detects weak topics:

```text
Weekly Test
     ↓
Topic Analysis
     ↓
Weak Topics
     ↓
Remediation Units
     ↓
Targeted Practice
     ↓
Re-test
```

The dashboard should surface this as:

> **Recommended today**

rather than exposing the backend terminology.

---

# 20. Milestone Architecture

Milestones are meaningful achievements.

Examples:

```text
Foundation Complete
Aptitude Basics Complete
100 Questions Solved
First PYQ Set Complete
Weekly Test Passed
Core Level Unlocked
Mock Exam Ready
```

Milestones can require:

```text
minimum mastery
minimum test score
minimum completion
minimum mock score
specific topic completion
```

---

# 21. Phase Gate

A phase should not simply unlock because the learner clicked every lesson.

Example:

```text
Foundation
     ↓
Requirements
     ├── Weekly average ≥ threshold
     ├── Required units completed
     ├── Assessment completed
     └── Topic mastery ≥ threshold
              ↓
         Phase unlocked
```

If failed:

```text
Gate Failed
    ↓
Remediation
    ↓
Gate Assessment
    ↓
Retry
```

