# 75. Most Important Implementation Rule

The final frontend should be thought of as a **visual layer over the NOVA learning engine**.

The relationship is:

```text
FINAL ZIP DESIGN
       ↓
Visual language + layouts + components
       +
NOVA BACKEND
       ↓
Real curriculum + real learner state + real adaptive engine
       +
DATABASE
       ↓
Persistent state
       +
ANDROID
       ↓
Same product experience
```

The result should not be:

> "A beautiful dashboard connected to some APIs."

It should be:

> **"A complete adaptive learning product whose entire experience is represented through the final supplied design."**

That is the architecture the frontend development should follow.